   "key": "40bb0b8e",
   "ru": "<FACE_INNOWNER><POS_RIGHT><FACE_NORMAL>\r\nКоманда “Морская звезда”: <MOJI0>, <MOJI1>, <MOJI2> и <MOJI3>!"
